<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00210">
	<title id="e01596">Opening the hood</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>hood 
					<indexterm>opening the hood</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<ol id="e01597">
			<li>
				<p>Pull the release lever (1) to unlatch the hood. The hood should pop open slightly.</p>
				<table frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01598">
					<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
						<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
						<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
						<tbody>
							<row rowsep="0">
								<entry colname="col1">
									<fig id="e01599">
										<figgroup>
											<image href="../../images/OOV035085.eps" align="center" placement="break" id="e01600"/>
										</figgroup>
									</fig>
								</entry>
								<entry/>
							</row>
						</tbody>
					</tgroup>
				</table>
				<note type="warning" id="e01601">
					<p>Open the hood after turning off the vehicle on a flat surface, shifting the shift lever to the P (Park) position and setting the parking brake.</p>
				</note>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Go to the front of the vehicle, raise the hood slightly, push the secondary hood release lever (1) inside the hood center and lift the hood.</p>
				<table frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e01602">
					<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
						<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
						<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
						<tbody>
							<row rowsep="0">
								<entry colname="col1">
									<fig id="e01603">
										<figgroup>
											<image href="../../images/OOV035086.eps" align="center" placement="break" scale="95" id="e01604"/>
										</figgroup>
									</fig>
								</entry>
								<entry/>
							</row>
						</tbody>
					</tgroup>
				</table>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Raise the hood. It will completely rise by itself after it has been raised about halfway.</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
	</conbody>
</concept>